<< /Type /Filespec /AFRelationship /Source /Desc (TeX source) /F (tag-AFfile2128.tex) /UF <FEFF007400610067002D0041004600660069006C00650032003100320038002E007400650078> /EF<</F 11816 0 R/UF 11816 0 R>> >>
